      "sourceText": "1.  **注意：**\n\n    1.  *一般电流值变量定义为一个数组形式，比如fp32 motor_current_target\\[8\\];这样就成功定义了8个电机要发送的电流值。*\n\n      *速度和角度位置同理，fp32 motor_speed_target\\[8\\];和fp32 motor_position_target\\[8\\];。*\n\n    3.  *C++电机PID库与C语言的电机PID 库有些区别*\n\n        1.  *因为电调ID的范围是1-8，而数组范围是0-7，*\n\n        2.  *所以为了和数组序号一样，这个地方注意一下区别：*\n\n        3.  *C语言库中，i的值为电调ID的值。*\n\n        4.  *C++库中，****i值为电调ID值-1。***",
      "translatedText": "1.  **Note:**\n\n    1.  *Generally, the current value variables are defined as an array, for example, fp32 motor_current_target\\[8\\]; this successfully defines the current values to be sent to the 8 motors\\.*\n\n      *The same applies to speed and angular position, fp32 motor_speed_target\\[8\\]; and fp32 motor_position_target\\[8\\];\\.*\n\n    3.  *The C++ motor PID library differs somewhat from the C language motor PID library*\n\n        1.  *because the ESC ID range is 1\\-8, while the array range is 0\\-7,*\n\n        2.  *so in order to match the array index, note the difference here:*\n\n        3.  *In the C language library, the value of i is the ESC ID value\\.*\n\n        4.  \\*In the C++ library,\\****the value of i is the ESC ID value \\- 1\\.***",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 299,
        "outputTokens": 201,
        "costUsd": 0.000331
      }
